      *> One card contract per approved quote. The card number and the security code are never stored: only the brand, the last four digits and the gateway reference.
       FD  PAYMENT-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 126 CHARACTERS.
           01 PAYMENT-RECORD.
               05 PAY-ID PIC 9(8). *> Primary key
               05 PAY-QUO-ID PIC 9(8).
               05 PAY-CURRENCY PIC X(3).
               05 PAY-TOTAL PIC 9(9)V99.
               05 PAY-INSTALLMENTS PIC 9(2). *> 1 to 12, no interest
               05 PAY-CARD-BRAND PIC X(12).
               05 PAY-CARD-LAST4 PIC X(4).
               05 PAY-GW-REF PIC X(40). *> Gateway transaction or recurring authorisation
               05 PAY-STATUS PIC X(10). *> PENDING, ACTIVE, PAID, FAILED or REFUNDED
               05 PAY-CONSENT-AT PIC 9(14). *> When the customer agreed to the future charges
               05 PAY-AT PIC 9(14).
